---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import boardImg from '../../assets/images/hci/board_cropped.jpeg';
import toioImg from '../../assets/images/hci/toio.png';
import wideImg from '../../assets/images/hci/wide.JPG';
import teamImg from '../../assets/images/hci/team.JPG';
import img2509 from '../../assets/images/hci/IMG_2509.JPG';
import img2514 from '../../assets/images/hci/IMG_2514.JPG';
---
<PageLayout title="covid taKedown — Alex Sheen">
  <div class="base_padding">
    <div class="w3-row base_container_padding">
      <div class="w3-half">
        <div class="proj" style="width:90%">
          <div class="projtitle white_text" style="width:100%">
            covid taKedown
            <div class="projtext" style="width:100%">
              <br />
              <i>Visualization of K-means Clustering via Portable Clinic Placements for Covid Pandemic</i>
              <br /><br />
              <div class="vl">
                <i>toio robots, 3D printing, projector</i><br />
                2023<br />
              </div>
              <br />
              For CMSC 20380, Actuated User Interfaces and Technology, we developed an <span class="beige_text">interactive system for optimizing the placement of temporary treatment centers or permanent hospitals for COVID-19 response</span>.
              <br /><br />
              The system integrates a projector and toio robots to <span class="beige_text">visualize the underlying k-means clustering algorithm</span> that drives the optimization process. Each toio cube, enclosed in a custom 3D-printed shell, represents a clinic location that users can manipulate to <span class="beige_text">physically influence</span> the algorithm's behavior.
              <br /><br />
              As users reposition the clinics on the board, the robots autonomously move to new locations, dynamically reconfiguring themselves to better serve patient distribution across the map.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w3-half base_container_padding">
        <Image src={boardImg} style="width:100%" alt="Board" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row base_container_padding">
      <div class="w3-half">
        <div class="proj" style="width:90%">
          <div class="projtitle white_text" style="width:100%">
            Design Deep Dive
            <div class="projtext" style="width:100%">
              <br />
              K-means clustering is a <span class="beige_text">non-deterministic</span> algorithm designed to partition a dataset into a predefined number of clusters. It operates through an <span class="beige_text">iterative refinement process</span>, gradually improving the positions of cluster centroids from an initial set of guesses.
              <br /><br />
              Our interactive system complements this non-deterministic behavior by <span class="beige_text">allowing users to physically pick up and move each toio</span>, directly setting both the number of clusters and their initial centroid positions.
              <br /><br />
              As users reposition the toios, the algorithm <span class="beige_text">continuously updates</span> in real time, reflecting how human interaction can guide and reshape computational processes.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w3-half">
        <div class="proj" style="width:90%">
          <div class="projtitle white_text" style="width:100%">
            Project Demo
            <div class="projtext" style="width:100%">
              <br />
              For an in-depth explanation and example use-cases, check out the demo!
              <br /><br />
              <iframe width="560" height="315"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gYJIfLXcPv4?si=oHBfjVOugFivdfS1"
                title="YouTube video player"
                frameborder="0"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row base_container_padding">
      <div class="w3-half">
        <div class="proj" style="width:90%">
          <div class="projtitle white_text" style="width:100%">
            Museum of Science and Industry
            <div class="projtext" style="width:100%">
              Our team was among a select few invited to demo at the <span class="beige_text">Museum of Science and Industry's National Robot Block Party</span>. There, we had the opportunity to present our work to museum visitors and engage directly with families.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w3-half">
        <Image src={toioImg} style="width:100%" alt="Toio" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row base_container_padding">
      <div class="w3-half">
        <Image src={wideImg} style="width:100%" alt="Wide" />
      </div>
      <div class="w3-half">
        <Image src={teamImg} style="width:100%" alt="Team" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w3-row base_container_padding">
      <div class="w3-half">
        <Image src={img2509} style="width:100%" alt="IMG 2509" />
      </div>
      <div class="w3-half">
        <Image src={img2514} style="width:100%" alt="IMG 2514" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
